NODE id=matrix/router/internal/fly.Provisioner.env kind=method
  digest=b3:ab568a3774197b084ff1577c6f3e107771c09a563c7419a84a11950195451996 file=router/internal/fly/provisioner.go range=128:145 lang=go exported=false byte_range=4189:4820
  sig=func (p *Provisioner) env(m *Machine) *provision.Env
  doc=env converts a Machine to the neutral view. Endpoint prefers the\nexplicit private IPv6 from Fly so requests don't depend on DNS\nresolution; when absent it falls back to Fly internal DNS\n(<machine_id>.vm.<app>.internal — requires wg0 + the 6PN resolver,\nverified live in matrix.kvx sess#26 step 3).
